  "gaps": [
    "Model transforms live in each baked GLB. Forge recipes declare any tilt; the app adds no per-model lean.",
    "Camera entries are the preset eyes rebased to the socket plane. Per-viewer framing, orbit and easing are render-only and not stored here.",
    "POUR (speeds, tempo, the exit guarantee's retry budget) is not here: no hook exposes it and no forge tool needs it yet.",
    "towerEye's lookAt is fixed at (0, 5.2*S, z0-1.4) and is not exposed, so a tool that wants to FRAME a named feature cannot aim — it can only choose a standoff. Framing tools can search poses and measure the result through worldToScreen; a hook returning the eye pose would remove the search."
